@princeling
title: Advance the Princeling faction.
subtitle: Sun Fo can help advance his faction of princelings.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; center_strength += 10;

We have reduced tensions within the party.

@education
title: Fund building schools in the countryside.
subtitle: -1 funds
choose-if: funds >= 1
on-arrival: funds -= 1; education += 1; economic_growth += 0.3; unemployed -= 0.2; west_relation += 1; rural_kmt += 3;

Building schools in rural areas increases our popular support as well as their education.

